---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms and Conditions"
  description="Read the Terms and Conditions for using UUID Generator. Completely free for personal, commercial, and enterprise software development."
  canonical="https://uuid-generate.com/terms-and-conditions"
>
  <!-- Header -->
  <section style="padding:var(--spacing-4xl) 0 var(--spacing-xl);border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-hairline);">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:780px;">
      <div class="mono-eyebrow" style="color:var(--color-mute);margin-bottom:var(--spacing-sm);">Legal Terms</div>
      <h1 class="heading-lg" style="margin:0 0 var(--spacing-xs);">Terms and Conditions</h1>
      <p class="body-lg" style="color:var(--color-body);margin:0;">Last updated: October 2025. Clear terms for developers and organizations.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Article -->
  <section class="container section-band" style="max-width:780px;">
    
    <!-- 1. Agreement to Terms -->
    <div style="margin-bottom:var(--spacing-3xl);">
      <h2 class="heading-md" id="agreement" style="margin-bottom:var(--spacing-md);">1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
      <p class="body-md" style="color:var(--color-body);margin-bottom:var(--spacing-md);">
        By accessing or using <strong>UUID Generator</strong> (<a href="https://uuid-generate.com" class="nav-link" style="color:var(--color-link);display:inline;padding:0;">uuid-generate.com</a>), you agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you should discontinue use of the website and tools.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. Ownership of Generated Identifiers -->
    <div style="margin-bottom:var(--spacing-3xl);">
      <h2 class="heading-md" id="ownership" style="margin-bottom:var(--spacing-md);">2. Ownership of Generated UUIDs</h2>
      <div class="feature-card" style="margin-bottom:var(--spacing-md);border-color:var(--color-ink);">
        <h3 class="label-sm" style="font-size:15px;margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--color-ink);">Unrestricted Commercial &amp; Personal Rights</h3>
        <p class="body-md" style="color:var(--color-body);margin:0;">
          All UUIDs generated on this website are mathematical values derived from standardized public algorithms (RFC 4122 / RFC 9562). <strong>You possess full, unrestricted, and royalty-free rights</strong> to use any generated UUIDs for personal, academic, commercial, internal database, or open-source software purposes without attribution.
        </p>
      </div>
      <p class="body-md" style="color:var(--color-body);">
        We claim no intellectual property, copyright, or ownership over the identifiers, strings, bulk export files, or databases you produce using our tools.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3. Permitted & Acceptable Use -->
    <div style="margin-bottom:var(--spacing-3xl);">
      <h2 class="heading-md" id="acceptable-use" style="margin-bottom:var(--spacing-md);">3. Acceptable Use</h2>
      <p class="body-md" style="color:var(--color-body);margin-bottom:var(--spacing-sm);">
        You agree to use the service in compliance with applicable local, national, and international laws. You agree NOT to:
      </p>
      <ul style="color:var(--color-body);font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:var(--spacing-md);padding-left:20px;">
        <li>Attempt to disrupt, overwhelm, or perform Denial of Service (DoS) attacks on the website infrastructure.</li>
        <li>Bypass security controls, inject malicious scripts, or attempt unauthorized access to server systems.</li>
        <li>Use automated scrapers in an abusive manner that negatively impacts availability for other developers.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- 4. Client-Side Execution & Privacy -->
    <div style="margin-bottom:var(--spacing-3xl);">
      <h2 class="heading-md" id="client-side" style="margin-bottom:var(--spacing-md);">4. Client-Side Processing</h2>
      <p class="body-md" style="color:var(--color-body);">
        All UUID generation, validation, and decoding are processed client-side in your web browser. You are responsible for ensuring your local computing environment and browser are secure and capable of running standard Web Crypto APIs.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 5. Disclaimer of Warranties -->
    <div style="margin-bottom:var(--spacing-3xl);">
      <h2 class="heading-md" id="disclaimer" style="margin-bottom:var(--spacing-md);">5. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p class="body-md" style="color:var(--color-body);margin-bottom:var(--spacing-sm);">
        This website and all related tools are provided on an <strong>"AS IS"</strong> and <strong>"AS AVAILABLE"</strong> basis without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied.
      </p>
      <p class="body-md" style="color:var(--color-body);">
        While we strive for 100% compliance with RFC 4122 and RFC 9562, we do not guarantee that the service will be entirely error-free, uninterrupted, or that client-side entropy generated on compromised devices is immune to local interception.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 6. Limitation of Liability -->
    <div style="margin-bottom:var(--spacing-3xl);">
      <h2 class="heading-md" id="liability" style="margin-bottom:var(--spacing-md);">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p class="body-md" style="color:var(--color-body);">
        In no event shall UUID Generator or its maintainers be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from the use of, or inability to use, this service, including but not limited to database key collisions resulting from flawed client-side clocks, data loss, or system interruption.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 7. Modifications to the Service and Terms -->
    <div style="margin-bottom:var(--spacing-3xl);">
      <h2 class="heading-md" id="modifications" style="margin-bottom:var(--spacing-md);">7. Modifications to Terms</h2>
      <p class="body-md" style="color:var(--color-body);">
        We reserve the right to modify these Terms and Conditions at any time. Any changes will be reflected on this page with an updated timestamp. Continued use of the service following modifications constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 8. Questions -->
    <div id="terms-contact">
      <h2 class="heading-md" style="margin-bottom:var(--spacing-md);">8. Inquiries</h2>
      <p class="body-md" style="color:var(--color-body);margin-bottom:var(--spacing-md);">
        For questions regarding these Terms and Conditions, please visit our <a href="/contact-us" class="nav-link" style="color:var(--color-link);display:inline;padding:0;">Contact Us page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

  </section>
</Layout>
